  - m_Id: 19212430482276352
    m_Localized: TUTORIAL FINISHED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19212792530403328
    m_Localized: You will be sent the control room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22434123413651456
    m_Localized: Grab the controller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22434176853278720
    m_Localized: Vertical movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22434191701114880
    m_Localized: With the controller on hand, we are going to take off now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22435307406950400
    m_Localized: Press the "W" key to take off/go upwards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22435941149507584
    m_Localized: Press the "S" key to land/go downwards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22435961005342720
    m_Localized: Move the "Left Stick" upwards to move up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22435982543093760
    m_Localized: Move the "Left Stick" downwards to move down
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22441253453627392
    m_Localized: Horizontal movement and rotation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22441429673115648
    m_Localized: Now we need to make the dron move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22441527723360256
    m_Localized: Now we need to make the dron move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22441695516491776
    m_Localized: Make the dron rotate using the keys "A" and "D" on you keyboard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22441869437501440
    m_Localized: Move the dron by using the right stick, the movement is depends
      on the dron orientation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22442216742649856
    m_Localized: Make the dron rotate using the "Left Stick" and moving it right
      and left
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22442496670498816
    m_Localized: Move the dron using the "Right Stick"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22446732170952704
    m_Localized: '"FPV" Mode'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23144810423189504
    m_Localized: Now try the "FPV" mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23145191706394624
    m_Localized: Press the "V" key to enter the "FPV" mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23145904960372736
    m_Localized: Press the button on top of the controller to enter the "FPV" mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23146716205875200
    m_Localized: Camera rotation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23147542173384704
    m_Localized: Now we are goint to rotate the camera, its easier to see in "FPV"
      mode
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23147850408591360
    m_Localized: Use the "Left Shift" key to rotate the camera upwards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23148003911729152
    m_Localized: Use the "Left Control" key to rotate the camera downwards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23148132639113216
    m_Localized: Use the "Up Arrow" on the "DPAD" to rotate the camera upwards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23148280307974144
    m_Localized: Use the "Down Arrow" on the "DPAD" to rotate the camera downwards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22435202360606720
    m_Localized: Press the "E" key to grab the remote
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22435392421298176
    m_Localized: Press the right button on the controller while looking towards the
      remote to grab it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
